      "text": "PPJxDệt_Phú_Thọ\n\nDomain:\nExternal Collaboration\n\nLifecycle:\nAnalysis\n\nProgress:\nNot Started\n\nGate:\nRegistration / Business Discovery\n\nOutcome:\nEstablish an evidence-backed ERP fit-gap and BRD for Dệt Phú Thọ across Sales, Production, Labor and Cotton Blending before solution or implementation approval.\n\nTop Blocker:\nNeeds Confirmation\n\nNext Milestone:\nAssign process owners, collect questionnaire responses and evidence, then authorize the BRD / ERP fit-gap gate.\n\nLast Verified:\n2026-11-12",
